This port rewrites Smooth Swapping's logic in Rust for Horizon's native mod
API and is distributed under the same licence, published with the
permission of Schauweg and Riflusso. The animation curve is the original's
Catmull-Rom spline, and the config screen (the curve editor and the test
inventory included) is the original's, redrawn with the game's widgets.
